# VedAstro documentation source of truth

- When working on VedAstro integration (MCP tools, requests/responses, parameters, formats, timezones, dates, transits/dasa calls, enrichment scripts), **consult `VedAstro-API-Guide.md` first** and treat it as the source of truth.
